      "title": "Grenadiers 1 · ♩. ♪ on open A",
      "goal": "Make the 8th after a dotted quarter short and late: 3 : 1, not a triplet.",
      "tips": "Count out loud: “1 (2) & 3 (4) &”. The dotted quarter lasts through the click on 2; the 8th goes on the “&” and leads into the next beat. Hooked bowing: the dotted note and the 8th share one bow, with a small stop before the 8th. The stop is also how the app hears a repeated note.",
